# Every write below is Excel-owned content written once, only while the cell still holds its v5.17 value (same rule as
# gov.gm_update), so a rebuild from v5.18 never overwrites a later Excel edit and the restore log keeps "unmatched 0".
# Seed data comes from gov_seed4.py (generated by tools/gen_seed_v518.py from the review workbook and the v5.17 cells).
#
# Steps (attribution, work order 第 5 節): each value-changing item has a step id. The environment variable V518_STEPS
# (comma list; unset = all; empty = none) switches steps on, so the report can apply C44, C69, D1, … cumulatively and measure
# each increment with LibreOffice. Non-value writes (grades, notes, Gov_Map judgement columns, Decisions) are always on.
